{"4288220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gag Order", "steam_appid": 4288220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> are a part of <strong>Research Laboratory's Guardian Unit</strong><br><br><strong>You</strong> receive an unusual distress signal from one of the core parts of the complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> arrive at the location of the signal, and everything feels off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> quickly realize that you've encountered something far beyond your capabilities. However, the only way to progress is to face it in a deadly battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>things</strong> that haunt these corridors can’t be released outside. <br><br>If <strong>you</strong> can't handle this, nobody can. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>In Gag Order each run consists of<strong> Two Phases: atmospheric horror exploration with invincible perpetrator and a fast paced team-bossfight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various powerful creatures, each with their own behaviour, fighting style and abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/bea763f7f1ef0b249803c981e6e0efea.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/bea763f7f1ef0b249803c981e6e0efea.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/bea763f7f1ef0b249803c981e6e0efea.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hints, No UI, No hand-holding. You need to rely only on yourself and your team.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/17991766f9ee139da2cd62ff7207dee8.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/17991766f9ee139da2cd62ff7207dee8.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/17991766f9ee139da2cd62ff7207dee8.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation technology built from scratch to provide a unique experience every session.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/766addb68a3e5056d819b68a3a3f042e.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/766addb68a3e5056d819b68a3a3f042e.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/766addb68a3e5056d819b68a3a3f042e.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity chat with realistic 3D sound and enemies that are always listening.</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/69cff9a3d976e57ef2da64c6901690e3.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/69cff9a3d976e57ef2da64c6901690e3.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/69cff9a3d976e57ef2da64c6901690e3.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious supernatural environment that can help you, hinder you or try to kill you. </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/2e9304f12a2621de03454020cffb2abb.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/2e9304f12a2621de03454020cffb2abb.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/2e9304f12a2621de03454020cffb2abb.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based interactions with the environment, enemies and players.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/0a635e26068b9db1e71dff3af4cde6d4.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/0a635e26068b9db1e71dff3af4cde6d4.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/0a635e26068b9db1e71dff3af4cde6d4.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> are a part of <strong>Research Laboratory's Guardian Unit</strong><br><br><strong>You</strong> receive an unusual distress signal from one of the core parts of the complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> arrive at the location of the signal, and everything feels off. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You</strong> quickly realize that you've encountered something far beyond your capabilities. However, the only way to progress is to face it in a deadly battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>things</strong> that haunt these corridors can’t be released outside. <br><br>If <strong>you</strong> can't handle this, nobody can. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br>In Gag Order each run consists of<strong> Two Phases: atmospheric horror exploration with invincible perpetrator and a fast paced team-bossfight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various powerful creatures, each with their own behaviour, fighting style and abilities.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/bea763f7f1ef0b249803c981e6e0efea.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/bea763f7f1ef0b249803c981e6e0efea.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/bea763f7f1ef0b249803c981e6e0efea.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hints, No UI, No hand-holding. You need to rely only on yourself and your team.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/17991766f9ee139da2cd62ff7207dee8.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/17991766f9ee139da2cd62ff7207dee8.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/17991766f9ee139da2cd62ff7207dee8.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural generation technology built from scratch to provide a unique experience every session.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/766addb68a3e5056d819b68a3a3f042e.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/766addb68a3e5056d819b68a3a3f042e.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/766addb68a3e5056d819b68a3a3f042e.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity chat with realistic 3D sound and enemies that are always listening.</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/69cff9a3d976e57ef2da64c6901690e3.poster.avif?t=1787256038\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/69cff9a3d976e57ef2da64c6901690e3.webm?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4288220/extras/69cff9a3d976e57ef2da64c6901690e3.mp4?t=1787256038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A mysterious supernatural environment that can help you, hinder you or try to kill you. </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post